<div style="font-family: sans-serif; max-w-lg mx-auto p-4 border rounded-xl shadow-lg border-slate-200">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 24px;">
    <h2>OfficedocTools Result Ready</h2>
  </div>

  <p>Hi <%= @user.email.split('@').first %>,</p>

  <p>Your file has been successfully processed by our <strong><%= @tool_meta[:name] %></strong> tool.</p>

  <p>You can download it at any time directly from your account history using the link below:</p>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;">
    <%= link_to "Download File", download_conversion_url(@conversion), style: "background-color: #6366f1; color: white; padding: 12px 24px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block;" %>
  </div>

  <p>Thank you for using OfficedocTools - Convert, edit and optimize any office document.</p>

  <hr style="border: none; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; margin: 30px 0;">
  
  <p style="text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #64748b;">
    OfficedocTools - All your document needs in one place.
  </p>
</div>
